---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Safety Guidelines | Airwalk — Safe Voice Chat" description="Airwalk's safety and community guidelines. Learn how to stay safe while chatting with strangers and what behavior is prohibited.">
	<header class="bg-canvas/80 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-hairline h-14 flex items-center justify-between px-4 md:px-8 sticky top-0 z-40">
		<a href="/" class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-ink">
			<svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2z"/></svg>
			<span class="font-extrabold text-lg uppercase">Airwalk</span>
		</a>
		<a href="/chat" class="bg-primary hover:bg-primary-deep text-on-primary font-semibold text-sm py-2 px-5 rounded-lg transition-colors">Start Chatting</a>
	</header>

	<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-12 space-y-8">
		<div class="text-center space-y-3">
			<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink">Safety Guidelines</h1>
			<p class="text-slate max-w-lg mx-auto">Your safety matters to us. Follow these guidelines to have a great experience on Airwalk.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="bg-accent/5 border border-accent/20 rounded-xl p-6 space-y-2">
			<h3 class="font-bold text-ink flex items-center space-x-2"><span>🛡️</span><span>Airwalk Safety Promise</span></h3>
			<p class="text-sm text-slate">Airwalk is voice-only with no camera — you're already safer than on video platforms. Your voice goes peer-to-peer and is never recorded by us. You can skip or block anyone instantly.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="space-y-8 text-slate text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">🚫 Prohibited Behavior</h2>
				<p>The following actions will result in immediate blocking and potential reporting to authorities:</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
					<li><strong>Sexual harassment</strong> — Unwanted sexual comments, sounds, or requests</li>
					<li><strong>Hate speech</strong> — Discrimination based on race, religion, gender, sexuality, or nationality</li>
					<li><strong>Threats & violence</strong> — Threatening physical harm or promoting violence</li>
					<li><strong>Minors exploitation</strong> — Any inappropriate behavior towards users under 18</li>
					<li><strong>Doxxing</strong> — Attempting to discover or share someone's personal information</li>
					<li><strong>Spam & scams</strong> — Promoting products, services, or fraudulent schemes</li>
					<li><strong>Recording without consent</strong> — Recording calls without the other person's knowledge</li>
					<li><strong>Illegal activity</strong> — Discussing, promoting, or facilitating illegal acts</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">✅ Tips for Safe Chatting</h2>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
					<div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-2">
						<h4 class="font-bold text-ink text-sm">Don't share personal info</h4>
						<p class="text-xs text-slate">Never share your real name, address, phone number, school/workplace, or social media with strangers.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-2">
						<h4 class="font-bold text-ink text-sm">Trust your instincts</h4>
						<p class="text-xs text-slate">If a conversation feels wrong, skip immediately. You owe nothing to a stranger online.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-2">
						<h4 class="font-bold text-ink text-sm">Use the report button</h4>
						<p class="text-xs text-slate">Report anyone who makes you uncomfortable. It helps us keep the platform clean for everyone.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-2">
						<h4 class="font-bold text-ink text-sm">Block toxic users</h4>
						<p class="text-xs text-slate">Use the block button to ensure you never match with a specific user again.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-2">
						<h4 class="font-bold text-ink text-sm">Don't click external links</h4>
						<p class="text-xs text-slate">If someone shares a link in chat, be cautious. It could be phishing or malware.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-2">
						<h4 class="font-bold text-ink text-sm">Never send money</h4>
						<p class="text-xs text-slate">Never send money or gift cards to anyone you meet on a random chat platform.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">🔧 Safety Features Built In</h2>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
					<li><strong>5-second skip cooldown</strong> — Prevents bot spam and serial skipping</li>
					<li><strong>One-tap report</strong> — Instantly flag bad behavior</li>
					<li><strong>One-tap block</strong> — Permanently avoid a user</li>
					<li><strong>No camera</strong> — Nobody can see you, ever</li>
					<li><strong>Peer-to-peer encryption</strong> — Voice goes directly between browsers via WebRTC</li>
					<li><strong>No data storage</strong> — We don't record or store conversations</li>
					<li><strong>Anonymous identities</strong> — Random handles protect your real identity</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">👨‍👩‍👧 For Parents</h2>
				<p>Airwalk is designed for users aged 13 and above. If your child uses the platform, we recommend:</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
					<li>Having an open conversation about online safety</li>
					<li>Reminding them never to share personal details</li>
					<li>Encouraging them to report and skip uncomfortable conversations</li>
					<li>Monitoring usage for younger teens (13-15)</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">📞 Emergency Resources</h2>
				<p>If you or someone you know is in danger, contact your local emergency services immediately.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">Report a Violation</h2>
				<p>To report serious violations outside of the in-app report button, email us at <a href="mailto:abuse@airwalk.live" class="text-primary hover:underline font-semibold">abuse@airwalk.live</a> with details of the incident.</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>

	<footer class="border-t border-hairline py-8 px-4 text-center text-xs text-steel">
		<p>© 2025 Airwalk. All rights reserved. <a href="/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Home</a> · <a href="/privacy" class="text-primary hover:underline">Privacy</a> · <a href="/terms" class="text-primary hover:underline">Terms</a> · <a href="/contact" class="text-primary hover:underline">Contact</a></p>
	</footer>
</Layout>
